# Architectural change document template

Draft in project/interim/<revision>/ as Markdown, then publish the reviewed revision to its GitHub design issue. Follow project/interim/README.md for provenance, fixed snapshots, reconciliation and cleanup.

## Problem and outcome
## Architectural delta and affected architecture
## Constraints and exclusions
## Ownership, execution contexts and failure handling
## Migration and compatibility
## Acceptance evidence
## Reconciliation targets
## Decisions and open questions

Use native sub-issues for execution; decision comments identify accepted revisions.
